// Page Page1 Text :
"P2687138872" "<color orange>You find a single cut on Hammett's right hand, but while it's deep, it isn't lethal.<br><br>Scrawled in his own blood upon his shirt, however, you read the following message:</color><br><br><color red>The Lords of Death are watching</color><br><br><color orange>Suddenly you hear voices elsewhere in the building...</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3764154695" "Listen to the voices"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P3755615872" "<color orange>Hammett lies dead on the ground his face frozen in horror.<br><br>You find a single cut on Hammett's right hand, but while it's deep, it isn't lethal.<br><br>Scrawled in his own blood on his shirt, however, you read the following message:</color><br><br><color red>The Lords of Death are watching</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3033634108" "Listen, {HeroName}. The Regulators aren't what we used to be. Hell, I know I look pretty ridiculous putting on my old costume, but right now, the people need to see the heroes out in force, now more than ever. That's why I want you to represent the Regulators here in Kings Row, to give all those people that lost everything in Galaxy City a ray of hope again. I'm commited to this, even if it is just you and I.<br><br>Unfortunately, things are pretty dark at the moment. The Skulls have taken it in the teeth and their leader, Veles Petrovic, isn't taking laying down.<br><br>With his brother, Chernobog, behind bars, Veles is striking out with a vengeance at anything that threatens his gang. New legislation to crack down on Superadine dealing here in Paragon City has apparently caught his attention, and in response we've had a string of assassinations against city officials that have supported it. Veles' scare tactic looks like it just might do the trick and silence the city council before they can even vote.<br><br>A lot of people need your help, {HeroName}, do you want the job?"
// AcceptString :
"P585305437" "I'll join you in representing the New Regulators"
// SendOffString :
"P2941975604" "That's the spirit. Ha, I knew I could count on you.<br><br>Now, I may not be as good in a fist fight as I was back in my heyday, but I still got an eye for details and planning. My guess is that The Skulls are going to target Councilman Hammett sometime before his speech tomorrow to the city council.<br><br>I want you to head over to Hammett's offices and provide him with some extra security."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3257770914" "Report to Councilman Hammett"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1269005752" "If The Skulls make a play for Hammett then your top priority is to keep him alive."
// TaskTitle :
"P2183304902" "<color deepskyblue>The Lords of Death</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2353708954" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Knock-Knock</color>"

