// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2258871422" "Stay back, ma'am, we'll handle this!"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1015969307" "<t 4>Nevermind that, open fire!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4077221454" "What the? Ain't you supposed to be a hero?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2244381785" "Councilwoman Simmons"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1583815128" "No no no..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1945790549" "{HeroName}? It's you?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3913862549" "Morana"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3042293151" "<color white><bgcolor black>Do you even know which side you are fighting for?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2192856293" "<color white><bgcolor black>We do not answer to the Family any longer, they have chosen to betray us!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P459672607" "<color white><bgcolor black>For that betrayal they shall die, as will those who aid them!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1305786029" "<color white><bgcolor black>Next time, {HeroName}. The Lords of Death are watching!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1159590233" "<em victory><color white><bgcolor black>Time to cross over, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2156478003" "<color white><bgcolor black>Death, {HeroName}.<t 3><color white><bgcolor black>Can't you feel his cold hands closing about your throat?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3938621818" "<color white><bgcolor black>Veles wants you both dead, it must be my lucky day!"

