// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P2497804371" "Hey, {Hero.gender=male what's the hurry, chief?|what can I do you for, sexy?}"
// Page TaskIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P1775000774" "Hey, {Hero.gender=male what's the hurry, chief?|what can I do you for, sexy?}<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P828399947" "I want to go upstairs."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P4017393278" "Nah, only fighters competing to become a Bone Daddy or Death Doll get to go upstairs, and you don't look like one of them."
// Answer Text :
"P3260430207" "Not yet I don't."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P55514809" "Alright, alright. I'll let Bone Dust know we got some fresh meat coming upstairs..."
// Answer Text :
"P3419556057" "Head upstairs."
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P126647979" "{Hero.gender=male Head on up, Bone Dust is waiting for you.|Head on up, Bone Dust is waiting for you. And hey, good luck.}"
// Page TaskComplete SayOutLoudText :
