// Dialog - BoneDustDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P878315112" "So, I hear you want to try and join the ranks of the {Hero.gender=male Bone Daddies|Death Dolls}."
// Answer Text :
"P58678203" "That's right, I'm ready."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P203862432" "Well, you sound ready, but only surviving the Rib Cage proves whether you are or not."
// Answer Text :
"P457838005" "I told you, I'm ready."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P4093783972" "You know that if you lose you lose your life, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P945675563" "A true Skull isn't afraid of Death."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P983566383" "Well said. Go and talk to the Fight Organizer, he'll set you up with a match."
// Page Page3 SayOutLoudText :
"P2193972490" "Well said.<t 2>Go and talk to the Fight Organizer, he'll set you up with a match.<t 0.1>"
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P3935697833" "Having second thoughts? C'mon, the Fight Organizer is waiting."
// Page TaskComplete SayOutLoudText :
"P2043737733" "Having second thoughts?<t 2>C'mon, the Fight Organizer is waiting.<t 0.1>"
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P3822798039" ""<color orange>Only the Task Owner may speak to Bone Dust."</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FightOrganizerDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P1497937455" "Bone Dust gave you his approval? Alright, I hope you kissed your {hero.gender=male girlfriend|boyfriend} this morning, {hero.gender=male dude|babe}, because today just might be your funeral."
// Page TaskIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P1608802826" "Bone Dust gave you his approval?<t 4>Alright,  I hope you kissed your {hero.gender=male girlfriend|boyfriend} this morning, {hero.gender=male dude|babe}, because today just might be your funeral.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P3572872120" "Hope makes you weak..."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P756297458" "Easy, save some for your opponents. Step into the middle of the Rib Cage, and prepare for the fight of your life."
// Page Page1 SayOutLoudText :
"P2822586276" "Easy, save some for your opponents.<t 3>Step into the middle of the Rib Cage, and prepare for the fight of your life.<t 0.1>"
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P4177078904" "C'mon, no turning back now."
