// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BackBreakerDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P2443282147" "Heh, you're as strong as Veles. Maybe he does fear you after all..."
// Page TaskIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P597709109" "Heh, you're as strong as Veles.<t 3>Maybe he does fear you after all...<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1969473113" "Where did Veles go?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2698365764" "He went to the lab with Atta, the leader of the Trolls.<br><br>Ha ha ha ha ha...<br><br>You have no idea how big this all is, do you?"
// Page Page1 SayOutLoudText :
"P3914222136" "He went to the lab with Atta, the leader of the Trolls.<t 4>Ha ha ha ha ha...<t 2>You have no idea how big this all is, do you?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1540906867" "Where's the lab?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3497309921" "There isn't a damn thing in the world you can do to me that will make me tell you that."
// Answer Text :
"P626135621" "Tell me where the lab is, scumbag!"
// Answer Text :
"P1835960735" "You're right, I'm not a killer like you and your buddies."
// Page VigilantePage3 Text :
"P1614080768" "Ha ha ha ha ha...<br><br>Or what? You'll kill me?<br><br>Even if you had it in you, death doesn't scare me, hero.<br><br>Face it, you've got nothin'."
// Page VigilantePage3 SayOutLoudText :
"P1820167144" "Ha ha ha ha ha...<t 2>Or what? You'll kill me?<t 3>Even if you had it in you, death doesn't scare me, hero.<t 4>Face it, you've got nothin'.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P410655170" "Deliver a message to Veles for me."
// Page HeroPage3 Text :
"P1966529418" "You'll never change a thing in this town if you aren't willing to kill for it. Think about it, zero, if what you're fighting for ain't worth killing for, why bother?"
// Page HeroPage3 SayOutLoudText :
"P3844465427" "You'll never change a thing in this town if you aren't willing to kill for it.<t 3>Think about it, zero, if what you're fighting for ain't worth killing for, why bother?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P3646434201" "Not everything is about life and death."
// Page VigilantePage4 Text :
"P1618607962" "What message is that?"
// Answer Text :
"P985373501" "When you see him in hell tell him he underestimated {HeroName}. (Knock him out)"
// Page HeroPage4 Text :
"P3028641386" "Of course it is. Everybody lives...<br><br><color orange>Back Breaker reaches for a knife in his boot.</color><br><br>...and everybody dies!"
// Page HeroPage4 SayOutLoudText :
"P2511191269" "Of course it is. Everybody lives...<t 3>...and everybody dies!"
// Answer Text :
"P243076393" "(Knock him out)"
// Page VigilantePage5 Text :
"P1670080223" "Wha...? Uff!"
// Answer Text :
"P1539496658" "(Plant your tracking beacon on Back Breaker)"
// Page HeroPage5 Text :
"P3082347728" "<color orange>Back Breaker collapses, the knife falling out of his hand and skittering across the floor. He's unconscious.</color>"
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P392283055" "<color orange>Back Breaker is unconscious and your tracking device is cleverly hidden within the collar of his jacket. With any luck, when he wakes up he'll report back to Veles and thereby reveal the location of the Superadine Lab.</color>"
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P2844751813" ""<color orange>Only the Task Owner may interrogate Back Breaker."</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2655523351" "We need to find out where Veles and his Skulls are getting their Superadine and shut it down.<br><br>I'm afraid that squeezing gang bangers on the streets just isn't going to cut it this time. The Skulls have their back up against the wall here, and the only way we are going to learn who or where they're getting their supply from, is if they want to talk to you."
// AcceptString :
"P2971705310" "So you need me to go deep under cover then..."
// SendOffString :
"P3718892136" "That's the idea.<br><br>I've already talked to Paula Dempsey about outfitting you with just the right disguise to fit right in with The Skulls. She can give you more details on it.<br><br>All you need to do is get in with them and listen. If we can find Veles, then we'll find their supply. Until then, just follow your instincts.<br><br>I'll be monitoring you from afar in case you get into any trouble."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P627408979" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Deep Cover</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2643632641" "Talk to Paula Dempsey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2654507481" "Paula is a wiz when it comes to gadgets and things. I had her rig up a few items that should be able to keep The Skulls from recognizing you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3067608524" "Hey, {HeroName}. Eagle Eye said you'd be coming by.<br><br> Let me tell you, I've had some strange requests before, but this one takes the cake. Are you sure you want to be going undercover into The Skulls? Sounds pretty risky to me, but then again, I'm no hero.<br><br>Here's your disguise. I've fitted it with a couple of experimental odds and ends that should be able to mask even the most eccentric hero from being recognized by the average street thug, just, be careful not to let it get shot or anything, that could be bad.<br><br>I've also got your disguise hooked up with a nano-mic and earpiece so you can keep in touch with Eagle Eye on the sly. Oh, I almost forgot!<br><br>Eagle Eye told me to give you this tracking beacon, you know, just in case things go sideways and he needs to swoop in and rescue you.<br><br>Let me know when you are ready to suit up."

