// Script Variable Caption :
"P2667793865" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Remember, you can't use your normal powers here or the ruse is up.<t=5 caption x=0.4 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Also, try not to get hit in the face, it could disrupt our comms."
