"P423257389" "<em=talk t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>We have a problem."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P750004353" "<em=armscrossed t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>I know...<t 2><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>It's {HeroName}...<t 0.1>"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P1086756672" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>It's not safe for you here."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2745708282" "<em=laugh t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Life isn't safe, little sister, but your concerns for my safety are appreciated."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P3915954491" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Tell Back Breaker to lock up the warehouse after we've left and shoot anyone who tries to leave."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2601436298" "<em=armscrossed t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Until {HeroName} is dead, nobody leaves here alive."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P3399471042" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>It shall be done."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3999537778" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Mr. Atta, if you'll accompany me, I believe you wanted to see my lab?"
// 3 Actor3 :
"P2624388750" "<em=armscrossed t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor Green><bordercolor white>Yes, Atta want very much."
