"P1410944685" "Veles escaped, but you managed to plant your tracking beacon on one of The Skulls. When he regains consciousness he'll return to Veles to tell him what you told him and lead you right to him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1965887205" "{HeroName}? What the? Your tracking device shows that you're at Royal Refinery, what are you doing here?<br><br>You planted it on one of The Skulls to lead you to Veles and the Superadine lab? Damn, {hero.gender=male son|girl}, that's some smart thinking."

