"P3004683104" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>I don't think Veles is bluffing, {HeroName}. I've tried his home, office, and cell phone.<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>There was no answer. I think the Facility Manager is somewhere in that building.<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>By my calculations, you have about 2 minutes to find the Facility Manager and get out of that building before it blows sky high."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3338488588" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Forget about Veles, find that Facility Manager and get him out of there."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1821136111" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>That place is going up in flames fast, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3782973751" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>The whole place is going up, get out of there!"
