// 3 Actor3 :
"P219274830" "<face=e1 ><em=armscrossed t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Veles, {Heroname} is here."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P250117314" "<face=e3><em=frustrated t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>How did {hero.gender=male he|she} find us!?"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P194370102" "<face=e2><em=talk t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>It doesn't matter how, Back Breaker, all that matters now is who..."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P3766642214" "<face=e1><em=shrug t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Who? I don't understand..."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P1752976593" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Who led them to us."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P3178800179" "<face=e3><em=armscrossed t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Morana, go. The lab's location is compromised."
// 4 Actor3 :
"P243289492" "<face=e1><em=talk t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>What about the Trolls? They are expecting a shipment..."
// 2 Actor1 :
"P2968888197" "<em=talk><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>I'll deal with Atta in time."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P1185768801" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>But first I must deal with {HeroName} and {hero.gender=male his|her} New Regulators..."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1711490181" "<face=e2><em=Laugh t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>I have a warm reception in mind..."

