// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1553315069" "<color white><bgcolor black>I've rigged this whole place to blow, {HeroName}. Are you ready to die with me?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P462769775" "<color white><bgcolor black>You don't understand what I'm trying to accomplish here."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P845971870" "<color white><bgcolor black>Why is it that the common man must rely upon you or I to champion them?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2789325753" "<color white><bgcolor black>With Superadine, everyone can be their own hero. Soon, people like you and I will be commonplace."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1529264242" "<color white><bgcolor black>If the tragedy of Galaxy City taught the people anything, it is that you cannot rely on others to save you."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P157106523" "<color white><bgcolor black>Your fate is in my hands now, {HeroName}."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3195293645" "<em lecture><color white><bgcolor black>Our fate is our own, {HeroName}. That is all we have, and that is what I offer.<t 4><em explain><color white><bgcolor black>But if you wish to prove me wrong, then by all means, save the Facility Manager from this inferno.<t 4><em laugh><color white><bgcolor black>Which will it be, hero? I do not fear death. Do you?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P3985606912" "Facility Manager"
// Script Variable PET_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3077424800" "The Facility Manager for Royal Refinery has been kidnapped by Veles and The Skulls as an insurance policy which Veles is cashing in now."
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2637888829" "Help! HELP!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P1215248689" "We have to get out of here! This place is going to blow any second!"
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P3750075728" "C'mon, let's go!"
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P3798020605" "You idiots, we're all going to die in here! Let me go!"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P1852549732" "There you are. Let's go!"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P4022568150" "{HeroName}! I can't see you."
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P1541645935" "Rescue the Facility Manager"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveText :
"P3828161526" "Get the Facility Manager to safety"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4145762041" "I don't have to kill you, {HeroName}, I just have to buy time for the fire to do the job for me."
