// Dialog :
"P626383374" "You shut down The Skulls' Superadine Lab. Unfortunately you weren't able to save the Facility Manager from the inferno."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P655509878" "The Skulls' Superadine Lab is already being put out by the Fire Department. Veles and Morana may have escaped, but without their lab The Skulls are going to have tough times ahead.<br><br>Don't let the Facility Manager's fate get to you, {HeroName}. You did everything you could given the circumstances. Hell, it's a miracle <b>you</b> made it out of there.<br><br>Find the good in today. You busted the Skulls Superadine Ring, and that's not nothing."
// RandomFameString :
"P1056332863" "I heard {HeroName} busted a major Superadine Lab being run by The Skulls in Kings Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4267871204" "You shut down The Skulls' Superadine Lab and saved the Facility Manager."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3587677191" "Great work! The Facility Manager is already being treated at Crowne Memorial Hospital and The Skulls' Superadine Lab is already being put out by the Fire Department. Veles and Morana may have escaped, but without their lab The Skulls are going to have tough times ahead. You've done it, {HeroName}, you busted The Skulls Superadine Ring!"

